      "userId": 1,
      "id": 1,
      "title": "How I started running",
      "body": "A year ago I could not run for 5 minutes.\nI started with 1 minute running, 1 minute walking - and today I run 5 km!"
    },
    {
      "userId": 1,
      "id": 2,
      "title": "5 tips for leg day",
      "body": "1. Warm up well.\n2. Start with squats while you are fresh.\n3. Keep your back straight.\n4. Do not skip the stretching.\n5. Eat protein after the workout."
    },
    {
      "userId": 2,
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Why I love yoga",
      "body": "Yoga makes me stronger and calmer at the same time.\nEven 20 minutes in the morning changes my whole day."
    },
    {
      "userId": 3,
      "id": 4,
      "title": "My weekly workout plan",
      "body": "Sunday - upper body\nMonday - cardio\nTuesday - legs\nWednesday - rest\nThursday - full body\nThe secret is to keep going every week."
    },
    {
      "userId": 3,
      "id": 5,
      "title": "What to eat before a workout",
      "body": "A banana or a slice of bread with peanut butter, about an hour before.\nNot too heavy - and drink water!"
    },
